257: 
258: - 컨테이너: `max-w-[420px] bg-main-bg rounded-[16px] p-7 border border-transparent dark:border-border`
259: - 헤더 아이콘: **accent** variant (`Layers` 18px)
260: - 반복 안내: `text-secondary bg-surface dark:bg-surface-elevated rounded-xl`
261: - 옵션 행: `bg-surface dark:bg-surface-elevated hover:bg-surface-raised border border-transparent dark:border-border`
262: - 옵션 아이콘: **compact** variant (16px, `text-muted`)
263: - 옵션 제목/설명: `text-primary` / `text-muted`
264: - 취소 버튼: `border-border bg-surface dark:bg-surface-elevated text-secondary shadow-(--shadow-inset)`
265: - 참조: `src/widgets/recurring-edit-scope-modal/ui/RecurringEditScopeModal.tsx`
