507: **매핑 규칙:**
508: | Artisan 필드 | FC Desktop 필드 |
509: |---|---|
510: | `timex[i]` | `timeseries[i].t` |
511: | `temp1[i]` | `timeseries[i].et` |
512: | `temp2[i]` | `timeseries[i].bt` |
513: | `title` | `bean.name` |
514: | `datetime` | `roastedAt` |
515: | `Enames[i]` | `events[i].event` |
516: | `Evalues[i]` | `events[i].bt` |
